# AeroOpt configuration.
#
# Nothing here is required for local development: the Vite + Cloudflare plugin
# provisions a local D1 database through the `DB` binding automatically and the
# schema/demo data are created on the first API request.
#
# Copy to `.env` only if you need to override a value. Never commit `.env`.

# Set to "production" to enable HSTS and production-only behaviour.
ENVIRONMENT=development

# Leave empty in local development. The frontend always calls its own origin
# (`/api/*`), so no API base URL is embedded in the build.
# API_BASE_URL=
